{"seq":1,"slug":"type-system","title":"类型系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sound-null-safety","title":"健全空安全与类型系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system/sound-null-safety","wordCount":1937,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"classes-mixins-extensions","title":"类、Mixin 与扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system/classes-mixins-extensions","wordCount":1370,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"pattern-matching-records","title":"模式匹配与 Records","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system/pattern-matching-records","wordCount":1178,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"类型系统\">类型系统</h1><p>Dart 的类型系统在 3.0 后经历了根本性重塑——从「可选类型标注」的弱类型语言蜕变为拥有健全空安全、代数数据类型与编译期穷尽检查的现代强类型语言。本章从空安全的底层原理出发，经过类与 Mixin 的组合设计，最终到达 Dart 3.x 引入的 Records 与 Pattern Matching，帮助读者建立对 Dart 类型系统的完整心智模型。</p>\n<p>三篇文档的学习顺序：先理解空安全如何改变类型层级结构，再掌握面向对象的类组合机制，最后学习函数式风格的模式匹配与数据解构。</p>\n"}